OL,3,GNEWSAEssex Police misleading on migrant
OL,4,Acrime - Farage
OL,5,
OL,6,FNigel Farage has accused Essex Police
OL,7,Fof "misleading" people about how many
OL,8,Fcrimes are committed by asylum seekers.
OL,10,FThe Reform UK leader said Rachel Nolan
OL,11,Fwas "completely wrong" to say nobody
OL,12,Fshould be concerned about criminality
OL,13,Ffrom migrants housed at a base in MDP
OL,14,FWethersfield in north Essex.
OL,16,FNolan said crime linked to the
OL,17,Faccommodation near Braintree was "very
OL,18,Flow", with 15 offences since 2023 in
OL,19,Fwhich a member of the public was the
OL,20,Fvictim and the suspect was identified
OL,21,Fas, or alleged to be, a Wethersfield
OL,22,F"service user".
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
