OL,3,GNEWSAEssex Police misleading on migrant
OL,4,Acrime - Farage
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Essex Police spokesman said
OL,7,Fincidents relating to asylum seekers
OL,8,Fthere "remain low", but that it
OL,9,Funderstood how communities felt was
OL,10,F"incredibly important".
